    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">seasonal variation</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">In time series, that part of the movement which is assigned to the effect of the seasons on the year.
(Source: ECHO2)</skos:scopeNote>
